  "description": "<p>Repository resources that make use of the external redirect feature of Fedora will appear in serialized form on disk as a zero-length binary. \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"FCREPO-2296\" >\n                <a href=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/browse/FCREPO-2296\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\"  title=\"Implement binary redirects export approach\" >\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10300?size=medium\" />\n            FCREPO-2296\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Closed</span>\n            </span>\n will implement the addition of the extension \".external\" to all such resources in order to mark them as redirects.</p>\n\n<p>The task of this ticket is to make import-export-verify handle such resources (i.e. recognize the extension, and skip over checksum verification since the resource is not part of the exported set),</p>",
